  "id": "BIT-couchdb-2026-86471",
  "summary": "Apache CouchDB: Admin credentials leading to code execution as operating system user",
  "details": "An unvalidated runtime configuration value in Apache CouchDB 3.5.2 and below on all platforms allows a CouchDB server admin to run arbitrary shell commands as the CouchDB operating system user.\n\nUsers are recommended to upgrade to version 3.5.3, which fixes this issue.",
